        "scope": "Same actual centered macro GammaP0 has printed B15 operator order gamma I, derived unit/bounded inverse/norm with gamma=2sqrt(alpha eta)/(1+alpha eta). No full-space inverse, extra gap/onto/unit/root premise, Test import, nontriviality or higher derivative. B16 polar, B13 H1, B14 independent branch, dynamics/main/errors/query cost and actual-input composition remain open."
      }
    }
